      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Steps 1-4 · building the evidence",
      "items": [
        "1 · Documents or a repository — neither one is required",
        "2 · Each becomes an immutable source; code stays separate",
        "3 · The worker rebuilds the graph whenever a digest changes",
        "4 · A person publishes a revision; nothing answers until then"
      ]
    },
