      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Steps 5-7 · using it, and closing the loop",
      "items": [
        "5 · Chat and Code Factory read that same published revision",
        "6 · A cited answer, or a draft pull request behind two gates",
        "7 · What returns: a postmortem, an RFC, a merged pull request",
        "7 · Dashed = you carry it today; proposed to be automatic"
      ]
